OL,4,C'We feed and wash her': Severe ME      
OL,5,Cleaves woman bedbound for five years   
OL,6,GRowena Davies had been planning to     
OL,7,Gtravel the world with her partner      
OL,8,Guntil an ME diagnosis left her unable  
OL,9,Gto talk or leave her bed.              
OL,11,FThe 42-year-old, known as Row,         
OL,12,Finitially thought she was burnt out,   
OL,13,Fbut after years of searching for       
OL,14,Fanswers was finally diagnosed in 2021  
OL,15,Fand her partner Shauna Chambers has    
OL,16,Fsince given up work to help the family 
OL,17,Fcare for her.                          
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
