OL,4,CVictorian railway station left         
OL,5,Cuntouched for 70 years goes on sale    
OL,6,Cwith suitcase still inside             
OL,7,GA Victorian-era railway station is up  
OL,8,Gfor sale at #135,000 after being left  
OL,9,Gempty for more than 70 years.          
OL,11,FHolland Arms station in Pentre Berw    
OL,12,Fwas the second stop on the defunct     
OL,13,FAnglesey Central Railway line that ran 
OL,14,Ffrom the village of Gaerwen to the     
OL,15,Fport town of Amlwch.                   
OL,17,FOpened to the public on 12 March 1865, 
OL,18,Fthe station has been disused for       
OL,19,Fdecades after closing in 1952 and      
OL,20,Fbears relics of its past, including    
OL,21,Frusted signal lamps and a cobweb-      
OL,22,Fcovered suitcase.                 G2/4 
