OL,4,CEvery day is living hell, says dad of  
OL,5,Cboy, 2, murdered by grandparents       
OL,6,GA father who raised concerns about the 
OL,7,Ggrandparents who murdered his two-year-
OL,8,Gold son says that every day without    
OL,9,Ghim has been "living hell".            
OL,11,FEthan Ives-Griffiths died on 16 August 
OL,12,F2021 after suffering a "catastrophic"  
OL,13,Fhead injury at his grandparents' home  
OL,14,Fin Garden City, Flintshire.            
OL,16,FMichael Ives, 49, and Kerry Ives, 47,  
OL,17,Fwere jailed for life in 2025. Ethan's  
OL,18,Fmum, Shannon Ives, 29, was jailed for  
OL,19,F12 years for causing or allowing his   
OL,20,Fdeath and child cruelty.               
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
